# AgentOS UI — Workbench source of truth

> **🔒 `workbench/agentos-workbench.html` is LOCKED (2026-10-10).** Do not edit it unless the user explicitly says to change it. When asked: back up to `workbench/backups/` first, then change only what was named. Locked snapshot (single-file, pre-split): `workbench/backups/agentos-workbench.LOCKED-2026-10-10.html`. The page is now split: markup in the HTML, styles in `workbench/css/`, behavior in `workbench/js/` (classic scripts, shared global scope, load order matters) — edit the matching file, never inline CSS/JS back into the HTML.

**Full token tables & audit:** `workbench/tokens/agentos-ui.md` (keep in sync).  
Reference implementation: `workbench/agentos-workbench.html`.  
Workshop: `superagent/superagent.html` `:root` aligned to the same cool-neutral contract (2026-10-10).

## Product layers

| Layer | Path | Role |
|---|---|---|
| **Workbench (outer)** | `workbench/agentos-workbench.html` | Spaces, asset catalogs, account & notifications. Entry shell. |
| **Workshop (inner)** | `superagent/superagent.html` (+ JS / `superagent-ui/`) | Craft / chat / build after entering from workbench. |

Match Workbench tokens first. Prefer `var(--token)` over new hex. If a value appears ≥2 times, tokenize it. Never restore heavy menu shadow `0 5px 17px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)…` on account/notify/team.

