Qualitative stages only — never fake precise % progress.

## CTA stage matrix

**Live = shipped.** Re-entry is iteration, not craft.

| Surface | Live | Ready | Crafting | Idle/Draft |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Scenario app | **Iterate** (soft) | Go to launch | Continue crafting | Start crafting |
| Scenario biz | **Iterate** (border) | Finalize (primary) | Continue crafting | Start crafting |
| Agent | **Try** (green soft) | Go to publish | — | Continue building |

Do not swap Agent Try ↔ Scenario Iterate.

## Chrome recipes (must match)

- **Popovers:** white, border `#ececec`, r14, `--popover-shadow`, item h34/r8, `--hover`
- **Cards:** border `#ececec`, r12 (dense) / r14 (scenario), footer `#fafafa` + `#f2f2f2`
- **Primary CTA:** near-black (`#171717` / `#111`), not purple / not brand-red fill
- **Selection:** `#e5f4ff`
- **Type:** Inter stack; base 12/16 · **list/card primary 12/500** · nested **12/400** · desc **11/400** · featured agent/mcp name may stay 14/600 · page title 22
- **Sidebar:** 256px; brand bar 54px; nav h34
- **Motion:** 0.12–0.14s only; optional card `translateY(-1px)`
- **Notify:** no unread dots / bell badge
- **Empty Market/Ops:** full-bleed soft `.empty-hero`, not hard gray tray

