## Anti-patterns

Purple page themes · cream `#F4F1EA` editorial · heavy menu shadows · fake % craft bars · giant file tiles · restyle card chrome for data-only updates · Live labeled as Go to craft.

## Superagent gate

Tokens map to Workbench · density 12–13px chrome · near-black primary · cool selection · same status language · light popovers · EN demo copy · Workbench ≠ Workshop IA without explicit entry.
